  <data key="d7">CH02_EN_PDF002_B003;CH01_EN_PDF010_B003</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MATH6_C0018" target="MATH6_C0021">
  <data key="d4">0.78</data>
  <data key="d5">Line segment introduces points and straight connections, which are foundational before defining an angle’s vertex (the common endpoint of two rays). The textbook lists line segments among the basic ideas that precede angles.</data>
