  <data key="d7">CH02_EN_PDF001_B002;CH02_HI_PDF005_B003</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MATH6_C0018" target="MATH6_ADD003">
  <data key="d4">0.95</data>
  <data key="d5">The textbook states that line segments are among the basic ideas that form the building blocks of ‘plane geometry’, indicating that mastering line segments is needed before tackling plane geometry as a whole.</data>
