  <data key="d7">CH02_EN_PDF005_B004</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MATH6_C0019" target="MATH6_C0022">
  <data key="d4">0.9</data>
  <data key="d5">An angle’s arms are defined as two rays sharing a common endpoint; thus students must understand rays before identifying or naming the arms of an angle.</data>
