  <data key="d7">CH02_EN_PDF003_B001;CH02_EN_PDF017_B001</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MATH6_C0019" target="MATH6_C0025">
  <data key="d4">0.9</data>
  <data key="d5">Acute angles are angles less than a right angle, described using two rays; thus ray knowledge is a prerequisite.</data>
