  <data key="d7">CH02_EN_PDF003_B001;CH02_EN_PDF019_B006</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MATH6_C0019" target="MATH6_C0030">
  <data key="d4">0.78</data>
  <data key="d5">Rays are introduced before angles; a protractor measures angles which are defined using two rays. Thus understanding rays is pedagogically needed before using a protractor.</data>
