  <data key="d7">CH02_EN_PDF003_B001;CH02_EN_PDF017_B005</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MATH6_C0019" target="MATH6_C0034">
  <data key="d4">0.78</data>
  <data key="d5">Understanding a ray (the side of an angle) is needed before students can grasp rotation as the amount of turn that moves one ray to another, as shown in the rotation definition referencing "first ray" and "second ray".</data>
