  <data key="d7">CH02_EN_PDF006_B005;CH02_EN_PDF003_B001</data>
</edge>
<edge source="MATH6_C0019" target="MATH6_C0035">
  <data key="d4">0.75</data>
  <data key="d5">An angle bisector divides an angle, which is formed by two rays. Therefore knowing what a ray is precedes learning about bisecting angles.</data>
