</edge>
<edge source="MATH6_C0019" target="MATH6_ADD003">
  <data key="d4">0.86</data>
  <data key="d5">Rays are introduced as one of the basic building blocks of plane geometry; therefore students must understand rays before grasping the broader concept of plane geometry.</data>
