<edge source="MATH6_C0020" target="MATH6_C0021">
  <data key="d4">0.78</data>
  <data key="d5">The definition of an angle explicitly introduces the vertex as the common starting point of the two rays, so the notion of angle is needed before the term ‘vertex’ is meaningfully applied in this context.</data>
