<edge source="MATH6_C0020" target="MATH6_C0026">
  <data key="d4">0.96</data>
  <data key="d5">The concept of a general angle precedes the classification of obtuse angles, which are defined as angles larger than a right angle but smaller than a straight angle.</data>
