  <data key="d4">0.85</data>
  <data key="d5">Understanding addition (basic operation) is required before students can grasp square numbers, which are expressed as products of equal addends (e.g., 3×3). The textbook introduces addition in Chapter 3 and square numbers in Chapter 1, indicating addition precedes square numbers.</data>
