  <data key="d4">0.78</data>
  <data key="d5">In typical Grade‑6 curricula subtraction is introduced as the inverse of addition, so students need to understand addition first. The textbook introduces both operations together but lists addition before subtraction, suggesting the pedagogical order.</data>
